<title>JAPAN: Shokubun - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shokubun - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.41		vs	    5.60</p>
<p> Operating	   42 million	 vs	  181 million</p>
<p> Current	     47 million	 vs	  121 million</p>
<p> Net		   33 million	 vs	   63 million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.40 yen	  vs	   11.31 yen</p>
<p> Shares		6 million	  vs	   6 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shokubun Co Ltd is a door-to-door meal delivery service.</p>
